        "TileImage": "$($repository 70ab4b17-bf5a-4233-a8e0-d6802022c10b).Image",
        "Description": "The German bureau of alcohol control was so impressed by your performance last time, they decided to reccomend you to some other countries. Because of this, we&apos;ve recieved many contract requests that have since piled up.\r\rThe first one to take care of is in the United Arab Emirates. The local government has gotten tired of the rich taking advantage of their own power to skirt their way around the prohibition, hiring bartenders with no fear. Remind them they aren&apos;t as safe as they think.",
